{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a gripping horror experience set deep within the mysterious landscapes of Lower Silesia, Poland. You take on the role of \u0141ukasz, a fearless investigative journalist driven by a relentless quest to uncover hidden truths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into a vast, shadowy underground world filled with secrets waiting to be unraveled. Navigate through labyrinthine corridors, forgotten chambers, and eerie environments where every step could lead to new revelations or unforeseen dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946670/extras/8b595934fc613116ed8cf395e3421bd6.poster.avif?t=1758290167\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946670/extras/8b595934fc613116ed8cf395e3421bd6.webm?t=1758290167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946670/extras/8b595934fc613116ed8cf395e3421bd6.mp4?t=1758290167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover cryptic documents, solve intricate puzzles, and confront unsettling phenomena as you piece together a dark conspiracy that threatens to rewrite history. The game\u2019s atmospheric visuals are enhanced by subtle VHS-inspired effects, adding a nostalgic and haunting layer to the immersive sound design and suspenseful gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946670/extras/8465e1c13bb86cc5dd8b2f83a92f7994.poster.avif?t=1758290167\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946670/extras/8465e1c13bb86cc5dd8b2f83a92f7994.webm?t=1758290167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946670/extras/8465e1c13bb86cc5dd8b2f83a92f7994.mp4?t=1758290167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you have the courage to face the unknown and bring the buried secrets to light?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3946670?t=1758290167","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946670/5c0067ba893e5cffa3dd4c6bc779582fa47a256e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758290167","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946670/bf94a5eb44850c0c5d45418002f879ad9ecf7df8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758290167","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946670/bf94a5eb44850c0c5d45418002f879ad9ecf7df8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758290167","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a gripping horror experience set deep within the mysterious landscapes of Lower Silesia, Poland. You take on the role of \u0141ukasz, a fearless investigative journalist driven by a relentless quest to uncover hidden truths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into a vast, shadowy underground world filled with secrets waiting to be unraveled. Navigate through labyrinthine corridors, forgotten chambers, and eerie environments where every step could lead to new revelations or unforeseen dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946670/extras/8b595934fc613116ed8cf395e3421bd6.poster.avif?t=1758290167\" width=544 height=306 >